      "value": "Yeah, I would also swear that I've also seen a similar error toast before (as in a year or more ago), but I couldn't find any bug reports about anything relevantly similar on here... It also has not simply \"gone away\" for me though\n\nEh, I just put exactly what I had done; the '\"New Instance\" from world tab' is actually what I describe as causing the adverse happening, I simply put my exact actions for ease of reproducibility in case it's actually a certain specific edge case that is causing the issue",
