  "details": "1. Own several groups\n\n2. Schedule an event on one group's calendar\n\n3. When event starts, open a world page on in-game menu\n\n4. Click \"New Instance\"\n\n5. Click \"Group\"\n\n6. Observe error message in popup and game log because the client is joining the GroupIDs on \", \" instead of \",\" and the server rejects this as containing malformed GroupIDs\n\n2025.12.16 15:09:25 Debug      -  [API] Requesting Get users/usr_00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/groups/permissions {{\"groupIds\":\"grp_00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000, grp_11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111\"}} retryCount: 2\n\n2025.12.16 15:09:25 Debug      -  [API] [69420] Sending Get request to https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/users/usr_00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/groups/permissions?groupIds=grp_00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000, grp_11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111\n\n2025.12.16 15:09:25 Error      -  [API] [69420, 400, Get, 2] Request Finished with Error!\n\nNo Exception\n\n{{\"error\":{{\"message\":\"groupIds array entry errors˸ ［ groupIds entry must be an ID˸ ' grp_11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111' ］\",\"status_code\":400}}}}\n\n2025.12.16 15:09:25 Debug      -  [API] \n\ngroupIds array entry errors˸ ［ groupIds entry must be an ID˸ ' grp_11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111' ］\n\n2025.12.16 15:09:25 Error      -  [API] [69420, 400, Get, -1 https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/users/usr_usr_00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/groups/permissions?groupIds=grp_00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000, grp_11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111] Abandoning request, because - groupIds array entry errors˸ ［ groupIds entry must be an ID˸ ' grp_11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111' ］\n\n2025.12.16 15:09:25 Error      -  groupIds array entry errors˸ ［ groupIds entry must be an ID˸ ' grp_11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111' ］",
